# VictoriaLogs 1.53.0 flags (02-TRD s10.1, AC-18.1). One flag per line; the
# logging role passes each line as a command-line argument.
# Retention is the only retention flag: 90 days (AC-18.1).
-retentionPeriod=90d
-storageDataPath=/victoria-logs-data
# Loopback listener (ops nginx /victorialogs/ proxies here). The role adds one
# more -httpListenAddr on the ops host's own wg IP for the shippers (LD-45:
# the address comes from the active inventory, never from this file).
-httpListenAddr=127.0.0.1:9428
